er-alleged-harassment-c8f15cfef9/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://haultimes.com/story/truck-drivers-stage-protests-over-alleged-harassment-c8f15cfef9/</guid><pubDate>Tue, 24 Nov 2026 08:57:38 +0000</pubDate><category>Drivers &amp; Jobs</category><description>Kenyans.co.ke</description></item><item><title>Motor carriers hurt by diesel costs</title><link>https://haultimes.com/story/motor-carriers-hurt-by-diesel-costs-d2796de249/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://haultimes.com/story/motor-carriers-hurt-by-diesel-costs-d2796de249/</guid><pubDate>Tue, 24 Nov 2026 08:05:00 +0000</pubDate><category>Industry</category><description>Northwest Arkansas Democrat-Gazette</description></item><item><title>Connected Fleet Tech: Cutting Truck Downtime &amp; Maintenance Costs</title><link>https://haultimes.com/story/connected-fleet-tech-cutting-truck-downtime-maintenance-costs-f52b94b9f7/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://haultimes.com/story/connected-fleet-tech-cutting-truck-downtime-maintenance-costs-f52b94b9f7/</guid><pubDate>Tue, 24 Nov 2026 07:49:59 +0000</pubDate><category>Equipment</category><description>Commercial Carrier Journal</description></item><item><title>Commercial Driver&#x27;s License: Nick Castello; Application for Exemption</title><link>https://haultimes.com/story/commercial-driver-s-license-nick-castello-application-for-exemption-a0443343ed/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://haultimes.com/story/commercial-driver-s-license-nick-castello-application-for-exemption-a0443343ed/</guid><pubDate>Tue, 24 Nov 2026 05:00:00 +0000</pubDate><category>Regulations</category><description>The Federal Motor Carrier Safety Administration is asking for public comment on an exemption application filed by Nick Castello. The request would let state licensing agencies issue non-domiciled commercial learner&#x27;s permits and CDLs to drivers in humanitarian or protection-based categories, including Uniting for Ukraine, Temporary Protected Status, asylum and pending asylum. The notice does not signal how the agency will decide; FMCSA will grant or deny the request after reviewing the application, safety analyses and comments.

The notice points to a final rule published February 13, 2026, which bars these permits and licenses unless the applicant shows lawful immigration status. The listed categories under that rule are H-2A, H-2B and E-2. Castello, described as a U.S. Marine Corps veteran and disabled veteran business owner, asks for relief of up to five years or a shorter period, and says he collected 93 responses from drivers reporting recurring problems with non-domiciled transactions. Comments are due December 24, 2026, under docket FMCSA-2026-3268.</description></item><item><title>Trucker Path app launches free CB radio feature</title><link>https://haultimes.com/story/trucker-path-app-launches-free-cb-radio-feature-a2b6ef683e/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://haultimes.com/story/trucker-path-app-launches-free-cb-radio-feature-a2b6ef683e/</guid><pubDate>Tue, 24 Nov 2026 04:26:27 +0000</pubDate><category>Equipment</category><description>Commercial Carrier Journal</description></item><item><title>Diesel prices soar as Silicon Valley startup unveils cab-less trucking solution</title><link>https://haultimes.com/story/diesel-prices-soar-as-silicon-valley-startup-unveils-cab-less-trucking-5c25dc2917/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://haultimes.com/story/diesel-prices-soar-as-silicon-valley-startup-unveils-cab-less-trucking-5c25dc2917/</guid><pubDate>Mon, 23 Nov 2026 23:27:06 +0000</pubDate><category>Fuel</category><description>Fox Business</description></item><item><title>CRST Drivers Win $1.8M In Truck Lease Case</title><link>https://haultimes.com/story/crst-drivers-win-1-8m-in-truck-lease-case-dcc5f006b3/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://haultimes.com/story/crst-drivers-win-1-8m-in-truck-lease-case-dcc5f006b3/</guid><pubDate>Mon, 23 Nov 2026 23:26:14 +0000</pubDate><category>Industry</category><description>An Iowa federal judge awarded nearly $1.8 million to close to 1,000 drivers that CRST underpaid under their leases, rejecting the company&#x27;s bid to deny recovery over unproven individual losses.</description></item><item><title>Little victories: Small fleets take trucking challenges head-on</title><link>https://haultimes.com/story/little-victories-small-fleets-take-trucking-challenges-head-on-2f8cd12b98/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://haultimes.com/story/little-victories-small-fleets-take-trucking-challenges-head-on-2f8cd12b98/</guid><pubDate>Mon, 23 Nov 2026 21:28:09 +0000</pubDate><category>Industry</category><description>www.overdriveonline.com</description></item><item><title>AEB &#x27;false positives&#x27; prompt recall of 6K Peterbilts, Kenworths</title><link>https://haultimes.com/story/aeb-false-positives-prompt-recall-of-6k-peterbilts-kenworths-2a483d4342/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://haultimes.com/story/aeb-false-positives-prompt-recall-of-6k-peterbilts-kenworths-2a483d4342/</guid><pubDate>Mon, 23 Nov 2026 21:27:30 +0000</pubDate><category>Equipment</category><description>eTrucker</description></item><item><title>Illegal immigrant truckers expose a deadly licensing problem</title><link>https://haultimes.com/story/illegal-immigrant-truckers-expose-a-deadly-licensing-problem-c9bccac913/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://haultimes.com/story/illegal-immigrant-truckers-expose-a-deadly-licensing-problem-c9bccac913/</guid><pubDate>Mon, 23 Nov 2026 20:58:02 +0000</pubDate><category>Industry</category><description>Washington Times</description></item><item><title>Four truckers with 100 collective years of driving successfully deliver this year’s US Capitol Christmas Tree</title><link>https://haultimes.com/story/four-truckers-with-100-collective-years-of-driving-successfully-delive-5de46895ec/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://haultimes.com/story/four-truckers-with-100-collective-years-of-driving-successfully-delive-5de46895ec/</guid><pubDate>Mon, 23 Nov 2026 20:57:56 +0000</pubDate><category>Industry</category><description>CDLLife</description></item><item><title>Trucker who suddenly went blind cen